{"version":1,"content":"<p>寶馬集團11月9日宣佈，已將三星SDI和LG新能源納入第六代高壓電池電芯供應體系。其中，<strong>三星SDI將在歐洲為寶馬供貨，LG新能源則負責美國市</strong><strong>場，兩家公司預計從2020年代末開始交付</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585736.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.124645+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:26:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"8bb1dfb407d93f0351baeee00ec7be0ade42758af54c6ab717e6fb8a2f2691b7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}